// EVOLOAD - copy slot Z (1=A 2=B 3=R 4=step start 5=subspace original) into the workspace.
// Out: [I] numerators, [J] denominators, M x N, V raised if the slot is approximate.
// The slot is also left in ʟMXW.  Clobbers: I J K
If Z=1:ʟMXA→ʟMXW
If Z=2:ʟMXB→ʟMXW
If Z=3:ʟMXR→ʟMXW
If Z=4:ʟMXST→ʟMXW
If Z=5:ʟMXO→ʟMXW
ʟMXW(1)→M:ʟMXW(2)→N
max(V,ʟMXW(3))→V
{M,N}→dim([I]):{M,N}→dim([J])
4→K
For(I,1,M)
For(J,1,N)
ʟMXW(K)→[I](I,J):ʟMXW(K+1)→[J](I,J)
K+2→K
End
End
